The remaining amount is 14 kilometers, which is the distance they go by the path.
The sum of the three parts is the total distance, so
$$ \frac{1}{5}x + \frac{2}{3}x + 14 = x $$
To solve for $x$, we first combine the two terms with $x$:
$$ \frac{1}{5}x + \frac{2}{3}x = \frac{3}{15}x + \frac{10}{115}x = \frac{13}{15}x $$
So we equation is
$$ \frac{13}{15}x + 14 = x $$
