$$ 14 = x - \frac{13}{15}x = \frac{15}{15}x - \frac{13}{15}x = \frac{2}{15}x $$
Now, we solve for $x$:
$$ 14 = \frac{2}{15}x $$
Multiply both sides by $\frac{15}{2}$:
$$ 14 \cdot \frac{15}{2} = x $$
$$ 7 \cdot 15 = x $$
$$ 105 = x $$
So the total distance is 105 kilometers.

