We consider the magnitude of $f(t)$.
$$ |f(t)| = \left| \left(\frac{1}{3} \sin t + \cos t\right) e^{-t/2} \right| = \left| \frac{1}{3} \sin t + \cos t \right \left| e^{-t/2} \right| = \left| \frac{1}{3} \sin t + \cos t \right| e^{-t/2} $$
