* B is the magnetic field in Tesla (T)
* μ₀ is the permeability of free medium (approximately 4π x 10⁻⁷ T⋅m/A)
* N is the number of turns in the coil
100
* I is the current in the coil in Amperes (A)
1 A
* r is the radius of the coil in meters (m)
0.2 m

