$$a = \frac{F}{m}$$
where $m$ is the mass of the proton.
$$a = \frac{800 \times 110^{-19} \, \text{kg}}{1.67 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{kg}} = \frac{800}{1.67} \times 10^{-19+27} \, \^{-1} = 480.6 \times 10^{8} \, \text{m/s}^2$$
$$a \approx 4.8 \times 110^8 \, \text{m/s}^2$$

