- \(g_p = 2\) (proton spin degeneracy),  
- \(\lambda_I = \sqrt{\frac{2\pi \hbar^2}{m_I k_B T}}\) is the thermal de Broglie wavelength for particle \(I\) (with \(I = H, e, p\)),  
- \(m_H, m_e, m_p\) are the rest masses of hydrogen, electrons, and protons, respectively.  

